      "writtenOn": "2023-11-06T20:18:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can Source/Sink Audio location also be passed to vendor in case vendor want to make Audio Channel Allocation also in config selection?",
      "revId": "a9916dfab537740cb9a7bf4aa258003130410ca8",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "85597f56_e9114660",
        "filename": "bluetooth/audio/aidl/android/hardware/bluetooth/audio/CodecSpecificConfigurationLtv.aidl",
        "patchSetId": 18
      },
      "lineNbr": 49,
      "author": {
        "id": 1929540
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-07T10:15:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Bluetooth stack calles vendor lib to get configuration per direction and not by allocation.\n\nAllocation is added by Bluetooth stack if the standard Le Audio allocation is used.\nOtherwise vendor lib has no chance to set allocation.\n\n@Jakub, maybe we should remove this enum?",
      "parentUuid": "7ec1f2d1_1a1d7b82",
      "revId": "a9916dfab537740cb9a7bf4aa258003130410ca8",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
